4. EXTERNAL PROGRAMS EXECUTED AT RUNTIME
===============================================================================

The Linux data path executes the following as separate programs. They are NOT
linked into, combined with, or distributed as part of this software. They are
listed for operator awareness.

  amneziawg-go     userspace AmneziaWG data plane      permissive, MIT-style
  awg              amneziawg-tools interface config    GPL-2.0
  ip               iproute2                            GPL-2.0
  nft              nftables                            GPL-2.0
  resolvectl       systemd                             LGPL-2.1-or-later

IMPORTANT: distributing a client, appliance, or server IMAGE that contains
amneziawg-tools, iproute2, nftables, or systemd binaries carries
corresponding-source and notice obligations under those licences. AGPL-3.0 and
GPL-2.0-only are not compatible for combination into a single work. Invoking
these tools as separate executables is the design, but that fact alone is not a
legal conclusion about derivative-work scope. Qualified licence review is
required before any image ships. See OPERATIONS.md and
docs/audit/07-LICENSING-AND-COPYRIGHT-FINDINGS.md section 2.4.


